# Title: Browser Execution In Headless Mode
# ID: ef9dcfed-690c-4c5d-a9d1-482cd422225c
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-09-12
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.stealth, attack.t1105, attack.t1564.003
# Description: Detects execution of Chromium based browser in headless mode
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.executable:*\\brave.exe OR process.executable:*\\chrome.exe OR process.executable:*\\msedge.exe OR process.executable:*\\opera.exe OR process.executable:*\\vivaldi.exe) AND process.command_line:*--headless*)
